.DS_Store
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]

# GitHub App credentials, if the App identity is ever set up against THIS
# repository the way a generated project sets it up against its own. The
# template ships the same two lines in template/.gitignore.jinja; they belong
# here for the same reason — a private key must not be one `git add -A` away
# from being published.
.claude/app-identity
*.pem
